130
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:05,180
麦琪:我无礼? 爸爸,谁走进别人的卧室,而她正和她丈夫躺在一起.
Maggie: I'm being rude!Dad, who is the one who walked into the others bedroom

131
00:07:05,180 --> 00:07:05,600
when she was lying with her husband

132
