138
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:23,240
埃迪:好呀,你对我叫,当我刚要请你去钓鱼.
Ed: Fine, shout at me when I have just invited you to go on a

139
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:23,760
fishing trip

140
