麦琪:爸爸,你没邀请我钓鱼.
Maggie: Dad, you didn't invite me to go on a fishing trip.

141
00:07:25,940 --> 00:07:26,580
埃迪:我当然邀请了.
Ed: Of course I did.

142
00:07:26,620 --> 00:07:29,420
为什么我提起那次钓鱼,那年你才六岁?
Why else would I bring up that fishing trip we took when you were six

143
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:31,660
还把我的所有的鱼倒进河里.
years old?And drowned all my night crawlers.

144
00:07:32,020 --> 00:07:33,600
麦琪:爸爸,你没提这事.
Maggie: Daddy, you did not bring it up.

145
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:37,200
埃迪:麦琪,刚才你确实没有听我说话?
Ed: Maggie, just when exactly did you stop listening to me?

146
